  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The idea is to have a component in VRChat SDK that has same or similar settings as dynamic bone.\nInternally it will use Unity's physical joints, thus it will be affected by other colliders.\nEnd result is that you can pat and cuddle others' tails and ears and they will actually react to colliders in your hands.\nSuch \"bones\" would also properly react to environment and props.\nSuch behavior is currently not possible with dynamic bone.",
